Package: agentbuddy
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aria Compute <hello@ariacompute.ai>
Description: Unified agent workbench desktop client
 agentbuddy is a native desktop workbench that connects to an agenthub server.
 It provides threads, task tracing, channels, connectors, shared files,
 scheduling and optional local execution nodes.
Homepage: https://github.com/ariacompute/agentbuddy
